    "description": "Five exceptionally gifted trainees battle their way through spy training, navigating a mix of top-secret operations and the stifling bureaucracy of German officialdom. But when instructor Voss introduces his chosen recruits to his boss, Haberland, and colleague Kocabay—presenting them as candidates for hands-on spy training (or, as the agency sexily dubs the role, \"Administrative Specialists\")—they can hardly believe their eyes. What kind of motley crew has Voss assembled here? Do these five unique, unpolished gems really have what it takes to become a perfectly oiled intelligence-gathering machine?",
